Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your\Nlife. Fighting for tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,go catch what you really want I want more,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone more? Come on, walkin'\Nup the door. It's my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it's your life Run like\Na wind, jump high, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.42,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah I know you're strong Believe you can\Nachieve your call Let's keep on going,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,how not dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your light.\NShine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong. Trust\Nthat you can achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.66,0:02:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you stop me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you know I've been looking\Nforward to this smashing law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,for sculling, so move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the color of the\NSupreme King's Haki glashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That brat can use it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use it, just like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You knocked everyone out\Ncold on your own, little guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's powerful. Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's the Supreme King's Haki too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those with the quality of the\NSupreme King stand above all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To Flamingo, you were\Nchosen by heaven itself;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.08,0:03:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,your Haki is the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a test to see if\Nyou're a real man or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any people who you want to kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to give you\Nthe strength to take revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,People I want to kill
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffy is of a completely\Ndifferent caliber than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,His birth nurtured a madness inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His fate fed him endless fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They changed this man\Ninto a perfect demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The ultimate evil made to grasp\Nthe world and tear it asunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.22,0:05:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tofie's madness will tear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,apart this world at the seams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eagle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Eagle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Batsuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Athlete!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Stinkable Whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A nobody like you never had\Na chance of beating Doofy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an ass kicking to get!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.34,0:07:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolfi, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep Straw Hat right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let that squirrely little\Nbastard try any more tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We were having a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Flo can't even move, you big evil jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you'd get your turn, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, you weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so icky?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's stinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use. What that's not right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament Haki should work on logia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But what makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Logia type. Whatever I am,\Nyou can't win if you can't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rubber tummy, Straw Hat—ignore him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just paper mache covered in snot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,did you just call me when I was a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was offered the heart throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,why would I want to be\Nassociated with all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're buffoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mouth still works if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're half dead already—what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's taking us like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Run the family and the family run stress,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rosa, and now we're\Nrunning it into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,brat—you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,better listen up! Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,up step aside
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you a lesson, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Duffy is king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His will is absolute,\Nand we all respect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there's no hierarchy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,between him and the four top executives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're equals, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Because one day, 30-something years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a gift fell from heaven, and the\Nfour of us were smart enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,to see it for what it was and nurture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:10:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We gave him the power he deserved\Nand turned him into what he is today,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a true champion of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You said they tried to kill\Nyou when you went to Marco?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But you brought your father's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're all happy you\Nmade it back here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You belong with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Doofy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Doofy, your power proves you\Nhave the quality of a conqueror.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Doofy, we support you in\Neverything that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Doofy, all we ask of you is that\Nyou show us your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Duffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that bruise on your forehead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Some street thug did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.27,0:11:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one little question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the guy who roughed up\NDolfi earlier, aren't you? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I just teased him a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did some jackass hurt you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I just tripped on a crack in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where exactly is this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to do\Nsomething about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.26,0:12:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Duffy, you're a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That means no one is\Nallowed to defy your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they do, we'll stomp them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not feel like a king just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.90,0:12:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But one day I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be the ruler of all the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We always had faith in Duffy as our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And we instilled that faith\Nin his underlings too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that vision has become a\Nreality because we saw Duffy for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,what he truly was and upheld\Nour devotion to his cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a real family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how Duffy treats us in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But nothing else to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you remember that\Nmy mucus is flammable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can shut you up for good whenever\NI like with a flick of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Only an idiot like you would\Nbuy into that crap, Treble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His dream is everything, but you\Nonly matter so long as you serve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all just a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You act like you're some chief of\Nstaff, but I can see the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo's puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A puppet, you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.15,0:13:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're falling into a trap! Room!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're inside his room!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He was barely alive in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he's covered from\Nhead to toe in my mucus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open your mouth already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do I need to do it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shoving this down your throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to say goodbye, law!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, I'm a captain too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I leave you and Doflamingo,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Forrestraw had to defeat alone.\NI'd be abandoning my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stuck on the ground\Nlike a miserable worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What pride do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tucked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.56,0:14:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sturban! Blame!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:14:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Leo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up little bros!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.74,0:15:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Started looking towards\Nthe palace all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I I don't quite understand why,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but it feels like a giant weight has\Njust been lifted off my chest. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No time for fuzzy feelings now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we just destroyed the factory, but\Nwe gotta haul ass, and we'll get wrecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder all that goop and stuff,\Nhe was actually super skinny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why my punch couldn't hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not some secret ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, you can die with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Put away the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,See you in hell, Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole palace just burst into flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopyland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to back him up somehow, Cub. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, we'd likely just get in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That man with Luffy is a\Nwarlord like Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's in pretty bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:17:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin! Good idea! He's hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And Traffy held his own against Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! His arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.56,0:18:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance, look! Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Lawland's arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you butting in on our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The man's still breathing, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm not done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.51,0:18:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave Traffy alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our fight now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll finish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kuma! Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.48,0:18:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullet strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:18:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.02,0:19:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.76,0:19:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Precious Metal Axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Cabbage! Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Up till now, I was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't cleaned up this mess?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cabbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take everyone and get off the plateau!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.42,0:19:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I do that when\NDoflamingo's standing right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me fight him just one blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving my friends in your hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,my goodness—he trusts me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,not only trust, respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,a straw
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,hat is my fan;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,favor from a fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can't say no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Portolomeo is still on the lower level.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We could use his power. Let's go find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do anything? Leo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Those cuts look pretty ragged.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can sew him up, that's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.42,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.92,0:20:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My watering can should fix\Nhim up. Good idea, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but first we should\Nall get to safety, like Lucy said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buggy, Mayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:20:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, a die for Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:21:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, till the end of the line, are\Nyou listening to me? You're a nitwit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stop being so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting precious time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your poor friend Law is\Nsuffering because he can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.26,0:21:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me put him out of his misery.\NIf you want to kill him so bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.46,0:21:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,then you could do it after you beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems you're worn out already?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you rather just take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as bad off as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that special move traffic in before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that didn't mess you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.10,0:22:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fast, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.34,0:22:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But your attacks don't\Nhave nearly enough weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Overheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.28,0:22:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Crocodile was defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.74,0:22:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're telling us a\Ncaptain from Navy HQ did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.18,0:22:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.94,0:22:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's gotta be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why else would his\Nbounty jump up like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out about this pirate group.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard their name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.36,0:22:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:23:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you showed up at Marine\NFord, falling from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.38,0:23:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done well to survive this\Nlong, but your luck runs out today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.60,0:23:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to wake up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.52,0:23:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.20,0:23:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And why would you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For the past 13 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.34,0:23:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the only thing I've been living\Nfor is a chance to kill Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.92,0:24:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done everything I\Ncan, but I'm all worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.60,0:24:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, all that's left is\Nto have faith in Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.28,0:24:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he's gonna win, then\NI wanna be there to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,By the same token,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.20,0:24:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,if he doesn't win, then I need to be\Nthere so that I can die along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.94,0:25:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who got Strahl\Ninvolved in this whole conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.14,0:25:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I have to see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.10,0:25:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.26,0:25:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.40,0:25:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Treffy, captains of a true pirate\Nalliance are on equal footing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's here of his\Nown free will. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.10,0:25:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If he didn't want to fight, he'd refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.10,0:25:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, please, leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.90,0:25:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose there's no\Ntalking you out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.14,0:26:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, you go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Cabbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.22,0:26:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't grant you a\Nquest if it'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.62,0:26:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.52,0:26:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear any complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.74,0:26:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do die today, it'll be after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.28,0:26:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Robin, hey, we should go or the lameo
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.90,0:26:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,is waiting he made a path go here please
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.36,0:26:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.38,0:26:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.58,0:26:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.44,0:26:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.68,0:26:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Grizzly Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.40,0:26:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.52,0:27:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to hurry so Law's\Nattack won't go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.88,0:27:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if you do defeat\Nthem, how long will that take?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.92,0:27:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a one-hour limit,\Nbut it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.00,0:27:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how long until the\Nbirdcage fully collapses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.42,0:27:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but you have to think there's\Nplenty of sick and elderly
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,people out there and babies\Nas well not everyone can run
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.72,0:27:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the vulnerable will fall\Nvictim quickly i'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.36,0:27:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it will only take 30 minutes\Nfor the fatalities to
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.76,0:27:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,start piling up after\N40 minutes have passed i
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.56,0:27:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,imagine we'll be able to\Nhear the screams close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.58,0:28:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then after 50 minutes, the kingdom\Nwill be painted red, as if it were
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.02,0:28:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,covered in crushed tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.62,0:28:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the screams will\Ndie out, just one hour until
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.26,0:28:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,only silence remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.82,0:28:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to do with this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.72,0:28:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't owe these people
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.82,0:28:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.73,0:28:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet the deaths today rest\Nentirely on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.90,0:28:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They would still be smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.48,0:28:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if you hadn't come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.16,0:28:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My kingdom would still be at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.48,0:28:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.86,0:28:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It It was all built on lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.72,0:28:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no place in the world\Nwhere everyone prospers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.24,0:28:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a waste of time\Ntrying to save them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.20,0:29:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a pirate passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.52,0:29:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to play hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.96,0:29:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare pick a fight with me, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.84,0:29:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.88,0:29:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one picking a fight with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.76,0:29:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You made so many of my friends cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.52,0:29:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And you made my crewmates angry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.88,0:29:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll keep hurting people\Nuntil you're stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.78,0:29:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to step up.
